WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:10.091
When my mom is busy, I help her out.

2
00:00:10.092 --> 00:00:14.833
Of course, I am the big sister.

3
00:00:14.834 --> 00:00:17.728
Hana: Mom, Hada is crying.

4
00:00:17.729 --> 00:00:21.043
Mom: Could you check his diaper?

5
00:00:21.044 --> 00:00:24.064
Hana: Oh! Can I change it?

6
00:00:24.065 --> 00:00:27.122
Mom: Sure, go ahead.

7
00:00:27.123 --> 00:00:30.925
Hana: Bada, get me a fresh diaper!

8
00:00:30.926 --> 00:00:34.247
Bada: Can't you see I'm busy right now?

9
00:00:34.248 --> 00:00:35.843
Mom: Come on, Bada.

10
00:00:35.844 --> 00:00:40.258
Your sister cannot leave the baby alone.

11
00:00:40.259 --> 00:00:42.989
Bada: Here you go.

12
00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:46.652
Hana: Hada, say thank you to your big brother.

13
00:00:46.653 --> 00:00:48.981
Hana: Let me change your diaper.

14
00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:52.174
Be a good boy now.

15
00:00:52.175 --> 00:00:55.284
Hada is such a cute baby.

16
00:00:55.285 --> 00:00:57.709
He is different from Bada.

17
00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.597
He smiles and laughs a lot.

18
00:01:00.598 --> 00:01:03.816
He listens well when I read a book to him.

19
00:01:03.817 --> 00:01:09.322
I am sure he will grow up to be a good boy.
